<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<Patch>

	<!--
		Too Many Mods' gene rebalance: gene stats and metabolism costs across many gene mods. Moved whole from the core root file AA1B_GeneRebalance.xml, where it sat behind the
		TMM_GeneRebalances setting (default on); installing this mod is the opt-in now.
		Each block sits in a load folder gated on the mods it touches (see loadFolders.xml); mods with no known packageId keep a name FindMod per operation. Checked with analysis/patch_sim.py against the installed mods:
		every op whose mods are installed applies. Blocks for mods not installed here are unchecked.
		Fix: 3 nested FindMods had their match op written as a bare <li> and never applied; they now apply. Two empty FindMod
		shells removed. Dropped the VQE Ancients archite gene recategorisation (category label/priority and displayCategory
		swaps, gene recategorisation rule). The pure exclusion-tag adds went to MMMM_Convergence-Genetics/1.7/Patches/GeneExclusionTags.xml;
		tags that are part of a gene rework (forsaken body emblem, insect wings) stay here.
		1.7 note (2026-10-20): the Merren block (keen reflexes 50% ranged dodge, fin ears / body fin conditionalStatAffecters
		removal) is not in this copy. Merren 1.7 dropped Stagz_KeenReflexes and the fins' conditionalStatAffecters itself,
		so every op failed. The 1.6 copy keeps it.
	-->
	<Operation Class="PatchOperationReplace">
		<xpath>Defs/AbilityDef[defName="Longjump"]/verbProperties/range</xpath>
		<value>
			<range>39.8</range>
		</value>
	</Operation>

	<Operation Class="PatchOperationReplace">
		<xpath>Defs/GeneDef[defName="Learning_Fast"]/biostatMet</xpath>
